notes               = "Untitled in source. He frees the doves hoping they will not come back, and counts them with dread when they do — the dread being for the ones that are missing. The doves are the same birds whose voices he paints in adobe-birdsong. زمستان ۱۳۶۸ is winter (months 10–12), so by the convention in CLAUDE.md the Gregorian half is 1990 (+622), not 1989. Imported as a draft with machine / lantern layers; ===translation=== left for Ben."
draft               = true

===persian===

کبوترانم را رها می‌کنم
که باز نگردند...
و چون برگردند...
با دلهره می‌شمارم...
و با غرور...
به غریبه‌ای که از راه رسیده است
می‌اندیشم...
زمستان ۱۳۶۸

===machine===

I let my doves go
so that they will not come back...
And when they do come back...
I count them with dread...
and with pride...
I think of the stranger
who has arrived along the road...
Winter 1368

===lantern===

I let my doves go
hoping they will not come back...
And when they do come back...
I count them with dread...
and with pride
I think of the stranger
who has arrived along the road...

Winter 1368

